 and correct order.","ar":"هذا الجزء الثاني، مراجعة القواعد. ستجد الخطأ، ثمّ تختار الترتيب الآمن الصحيح."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"rana","start":14.446,"text":{"en":"Each sentence has one mistake. Find it, then say the correct sentence.","ar":"في كلّ جملة خطأ واحد. اعثر عليه، ثمّ قل الجملة الصحيحة."},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"rana","start":20.388,"text":{"en":"You wear your gloves in the workshop.","ar":"صحّح هذه الجملة: You wear your gloves in the workshop."},"subHold":7.625,"id":"L004"},{"actor":"rana","start":28.013,"text":{"en":"The correct sentence drops the you: wear your gloves in the workshop.","ar":"الجملة الصحيحة تحذف you: wear your gloves in the workshop."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"rana","start":32.587,"text":{"en":"Not touch the hot engine.","ar":"صحّح هذه الجملة: Not touch the hot engine."},"subHold":6.51,"id":"L006"},{"actor":"rana","start":39.097,"text":{"en":"Don't touch the hot engine. A negative imperative needs Don't.","ar":"Don't touch the hot engine. الأمر المنفي يحتاج Don't."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"rana","start":44.055,"text":{"en":"First raise the car, then chock the wheels.","ar":"صحّح هذه الجملة: First raise the car, then chock the wheels."},"subHold":8.674,"id":"L008"},{"actor":"rana","start":52.729,"text":{"en":"First chock the wheels, then raise the car. The safe order matters.","ar":"First chock the wheels, then raise the car. الترتيب الآمن مهمّ."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"rana","start":57.999,"text":{"en":"Please to clean your area.","ar":"صحّح هذه الجملة: Please to clean your area."},"subHold":6.545,"id":"L010"},{"actor":"rana","start":64.544,"text":{"en":"Please clean your area. No to after please.","ar":"Please clean your area. لا نضع to بعد please."},"id":"L011"},{"actor":"tarek","start":68.566,"text":{"en":"Now choose the correct answer.","ar":"الآن اختر الجواب الصحيح."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"tarek","start":71.628,"text":{"en":"Which is a correct instruction: wear your safety glasses, or you wearing safety glasses?","ar":"أيّهما تعليم صحيح: wear your safety glasses، أم you wearing safety glasses؟"},"subHold":13.904,"id":"L013"},{"actor":"tarek","start":85.532,"text":{"en":"Wear your safety glasses.","ar":"Wear your safety glasses. وهي الصحيحة."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"tarek","start":88.378,"text":{"en":"Which order is safe and correct?","ar":"أيّ ترتيب آمن وصحيح؟"},"subHold":7.57,"id":"L015"},{"actor":"tarek","start":95.948,"text":{"en":"First chock the wheels, then raise the car.","ar":"First chock the wheels, then raise the car. وهي الصحيحة."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"tarek","start":99.994,"text":{"en":"Now, write two safety rules for your own bay.","ar":"الآن، اكتب قاعدتَي أمان لموقعك."},"id":"L017"},{"actor":"tarek","start":104.184,"text":{"en":"One with an imperative, and one starting with Never.","ar":"واحدة بفعل أمر، وواحدة تبدأ بـ Never."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"tarek","start":108.542,"text":{"en":"Pause the video, and write them now.","ar":"أوقف الفيديو، واكتبهما الآن."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"tarek","start":112.012,"text":{"en":"Here is an example. Put your tools back on the board. Never leave oil on the floor.","ar":"هذا مثال. أعد عُدّتك إلى اللوح. لا تترك زيتاً على الأرض أبداً."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"rana","start":119.706,"text":{"en":"You will see imperatives and sequencers again in the Part 5 reading.","ar":"ستجد أفعال الأمر وكلمات الترتيب مرّة أخرى في قراءة الجزء الخامس."},"id":"L021"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"93ac0efcf449be85","bytes":39024,"sha":"cf4ac4457599bf6a","address":"lines/93ac0efcf449be85.mp3"},{"key":"e64d8b356cab63da","bytes":40752,"sha":"bb27a05cfbe50d2a","address":"lines/e64d8b356cab63da.mp3"},{"key":"4fd71df1e0090b97","bytes":33552,"sha":"2ba403fe2585ec9d","address":"lines/4fd71df1e0090b97.mp3"},{"key":"28372fd5a25cc2f1","bytes":14688,"sha":"a5627c1464963dc6","address":"lines/28372fd5a25cc2f1.mp3"},{"key":"f59f822e305154d